This is due to an update in vue router likely that breaks the `event.state` in the popstate handler causing the state to be empty. the solution is to always read:

```
          onUpdate(cb) {
            this._onPopState = () => {
              cb(this.read());
            };
            window.addEventListener('popstate', this._onPopState);
          },
```

